{
  "name": "Notion 到期待辦推 Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s-l1",
      "name": "使用者需求摘要",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "### 使用者需求摘要\n每天 8 點整理 Notion 待辦資料庫今天到期的項目，貼到 Slack。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Every day 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Get due todos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": ""
        },
        "returnAll": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "需管理員建立：type=notionApi、建議名稱=notion-todo-reader"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Build message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateIndividualFields",
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "name"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#todo"
        },
        "text": "={{ \"今天到期：\" + $json.name.join(\"、\") }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "name": "corp-slack-bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-l3",
      "name": "AI 實作說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "### 🤖 AI 實作說明 — Notion 到期待辦推 Slack\n\n**參考來源**\n- 沒有參考外部範本，依需求與 Pack 內建規格設計\n- 骨架與統計知識：research/patterns.md §2 schedule\n- 原廠／社群 Skill：無\n- 目標 n8n 版本：2.44.6（使用者提供）\n- 參考方式：只參考做法，已用目前版本節點重新建構\n\n**建議事項**\n- `error:no-handling`：尚未能自動檢查（Notion 或 Slack 失敗時沒有備援）\n- 不適用：webhook:no-auth、form:no-auth、exec:ssh\n- `native-first:code-node`：已採用（未使用 Code 節點）\n- 以上皆為建議，最終決定在使用者；建議不等於安全\n\n**資安掃描結果**\n- 未執行資安掃描：由宿主檢查\n\n**所需 Credentials**\n- [ ] Slack API：`corp-slack-bot`（節點：Post to Slack）\n\n**待補憑證**\n- [ ] 需管理員建立：type=notionApi、建議名稱=notion-todo-reader（節點：Get due todos）\n- 在管理員建立並更新 credentialMap 之前，CI 會因憑證缺失或啟用檢查而失敗，這是預期且正確的行為\n\n**已知限制**\n- 參數名稱未經查證\n- 篩選「今天到期」的條件尚未設定，需使用者確認欄位名稱"
      }
    }
  ],
